					Dom. 3, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">militaris viae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Pis. 17, 40</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">castrorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Caes. 58</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">obsessionem alicuius omittere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Caes.
					B. C. 3, 24 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
